#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:21
msgid ""
"The [Core contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/README.md) explains both mechanisms and their "
"failure boundaries. Callers provide zero-initialized state, keep plans and "
"owner receipts alive, serialize lifecycle calls and join users before stop. "
"Factory lookup and ordinary I/O do not pass through either lifecycle engine."
" Complete types, callback requirements and C/C++ declarations remain in the "
"linked public headers; neither mechanism starts a scheduler or establishes "
"physical support."
msgstr ""
"[Core 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/core/README.md)说明两种机制及其失败边界。调用者提供首次清零的状态，保持 plan 与 owner "
"收条存活，串行执行生命周期调用，并在 stop 前等待退出使用者。factory 查询与正常 I/O 不经过这两个生命周期引擎。完整类型、回调要求和 "
"C／C++ 声明由链接的公共头定义；这两种机制均不启动 scheduler，也不建立物理支持。"

