#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:32
msgid ""
"The weak default returns and has no state or side effects. A product may "
"supply one strong implementation, bounded and allocation-free in every "
"calling task/ISR/masked context. No functioning kernel, clock, stack, "
"transport or peripheral may be assumed after corruption. This is best-effort"
" observation, not stack repair, safe outputs or reset proof. The hook must "
"not acquire OS locks, reenter the provider, change incoming masks, mutate "
"accepted requests or release retained storage. If it returns, the terminal "
"caller still parks. A product may perform a separately reviewed non-"
"returning recovery action. No retained event, registry or worker is "
"implicit."
msgstr ""
"默认弱实现直接返回，不保存状态，也不产生副作用。产品可提供一个强实现，但在每种调用它的任务／ISR／已屏蔽上下文中都必须有界且不分配内存。发生损坏后，不得假定内核、时钟、栈、传输或外设仍正常。这里只提供尽力而为的观察，不修复栈，也不证明安全输出或复位。hook"
" 不得取得 OS 锁、重入 provider、改变传入屏蔽、修改已接受的请求或释放保留的存储。若 hook "
"返回，终止路径的调用方仍将停驻。产品可执行另行审查且不返回的恢复操作。不隐式保留事件、注册表或 worker。"

