#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:40
msgid ""
"Use these attributes on variable definitions, before the type, one variable "
"per declaration. They are not function or instruction attributes. Each use "
"has an independent input section for garbage collection of unused storage. "
"DATA copies its initializer from Flash at reset. BSS is zeroed at reset. "
"NOINIT is neither copied nor cleared; initialize it before reading. Power-"
"loss retention is not promised. BSS/NOINIT reject nonzero initializers. "
"Storage is word aligned and subject to explicit ELF budgets. Unselected use "
"is a compile error. TCM is CPU-only data: never DMA or executable storage. "
"CCM is also CPU-only data; placement never grants bus-master access. ADDSRAM"
" DMA requires provider address, alignment and ownership validation. Ordinary"
" storage, the main MSP and unselected images keep their existing layout. "
"U575 SRAM4 selection also prepares reset-owned PWR/SRAM4/LPDMA run gates; "
"autonomous operation and DMA borrow admission require their own provider."
msgstr ""
"这些属性用于变量定义，置于类型之前，每个声明只定义一个变量；它们不是函数或指令属性。每次使用都有独立的输入 section，便于回收未使用存储。DATA"
" 在复位时从 Flash 复制初始值；BSS 在复位时清零；NOINIT 既不复制也不清零，读取前必须初始化。不承诺掉电保持。BSS/NOINIT "
"拒绝非零初始值。存储按字对齐，并受显式 ELF 预算约束。未选入时使用会触发编译错误。TCM 仅用于 CPU 数据，绝不能用作 DMA "
"或可执行存储。CCM 同样仅用于 CPU 数据，放置在其中不授予总线主设备访问权限。ADDSRAM DMA 仍须由 provider "
"验证地址、对齐和所有权。普通存储、主 MSP 及未选入的镜像保留现有布局。U575 SRAM4 选择还会准备由复位流程拥有的 "
"PWR/SRAM4/LPDMA 运行门控；自主运行及 DMA 借用接纳仍需各自的 provider。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:46
