#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:48
msgid "Adapter-owned stable cancellation identity."
msgstr "适配器拥有的稳定取消身份。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:48
msgid ""
"The slot, not a possibly freed request, is targeted by cross- task commands."
" Serialize bind/lookup/release in the adapter. Keep slot and command storage"
" until command acknowledgement; epoch exhaustion rejects rebinding rather "
"than reusing IDs."
msgstr ""
"跨任务命令针对槽，而不针对可能已释放的请求。在适配器中串行化 bind/lookup/release。保留槽与命令存储，直到命令获确认；epoch "
"耗尽时拒绝重新绑定，不复用 ID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:54
msgid "request_observer.h"
msgstr "request_observer.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "Optional stable-identity request observation without locks."
msgstr "可选、无锁、基于稳定身份的请求观察。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "Bind the exact live incarnation without storing its pointer."
msgstr "绑定准确且存活的实例世代，不存储其指针。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/detached sidecar, distinct control."
msgstr "[inout] 全新且已零初始化，或已撤离的 sidecar；控制存储须独立。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "[in] Stable caller slot, protected by caller exclusion."
msgstr "[in] 由调用者互斥保护的稳定调用者槽。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "[in] Nonzero exact slot incarnation, never regenerated."
msgstr "[in] 非零且精确的槽实例代次，绝不重新生成。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE, no retained reference on rejection."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；拒绝时不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "Copy state and acquire-observed final result for exact epoch."
msgstr "复制准确 epoch 的状态，以及以 acquire 观察的最终结果。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid ""
"Borrowed state exposes no speculative result/count. NULL slot, stale epoch "
"and overlap reject before request access. This neither services hardware nor"
" interprets deadline as borrow release. Caller guarantees binding storage "
"lifetime. Output is disjoint from the complete descriptor and borrowed "
"buffers; only the common request span is checked here."
msgstr ""
"借用状态不暴露推测的结果／计数。NULL 槽、过期 epoch 和重叠均在访问请求前拒绝。它既不推进硬件，也不把 deadline "
"解释为借用释放。调用者保证绑定存储的生命周期。输出须与完整描述符及已借用缓冲区不重叠；这里只检查公共 request 跨度。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "[inout] Bound sidecar under caller serialization."
msgstr "[inout] 由调用者串行化保护的已绑定 sidecar。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "[in] Same monotonic domain as the request deadline."
msgstr "[in] 与请求 deadline 相同的单调时间域。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on error."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；错误时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, STATE for stale/released identity, INVALID for invalid arguments or"
" IO for reversed time. Counters saturate without epoch reuse."
msgstr ""
"成功返回 SUCCESS；身份标识过期／已释放返回 STATE；参数无效返回 INVALID；时间倒退返回 IO；计数器饱和，不复用 epoch。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "Remove only this sidecar reference, leaving loans untouched."
msgstr "仅移除此附加观察引用，不改变借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid ""
"Caller-serialized; allowed while request is quarantined. It is not request "
"settlement, slot release or destruction."
msgstr "由调用者串行化；请求处于 QUARANTINED 时也允许调用。它不表示请求结算、槽释放或销毁。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "[inout] Live sidecar after all its readers have exited."
msgstr "[inout] 所有读取者均已退出后的存续 sidecar。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "Copied facts; result/count are valid only when settled is true."
msgstr "已复制的事实；仅 settled 为 true 时 result/count 有效。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid "Caller-owned optional sidecar, fresh zero storage before bind."
msgstr "调用者拥有的可选附加状态，绑定之前必须使用全新清零存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:56
msgid ""
"One serialized observer; no Arch/OS/SoC dependency or lock. Caller excludes "
"slot bind/release, request prepare/reuse and concurrent observer calls "
"during sample. Stable slot stays alive until detach; observing never "
"acquires/releases a loan."
msgstr ""
"只允许一个串行化观察者；不依赖 Arch/OS/SoC，也不使用锁。采样期间调用者须排除槽 bind/release、请求 prepare/reuse "
"及并发观察调用。稳定槽须存续至 detach；观察绝不取得或释放借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:62
msgid "stack_observation.h"
msgstr "stack_observation.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "Bounded read-only observation of caller-painted stack spans."
msgstr "对调用者涂色的栈范围作有界只读观察。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "Read a bounded low-address paint prefix without mutation."
msgstr "读取有界的低地址涂色前缀，不修改存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid ""
"Caller ensures this region is quiescent and painting had no live frames. No "
"Arch/OS dependency or internal mask occurs. Work is at most bytes reads. "
"Unwritten reservations or writes equal to paint can hide usage; this is not "
"overflow detection. MSP qualification needs independently established boot "
"paint and a quiescent sampling point. The span excludes current SP, all "
"active frames and exception-stack reservation. It never paints or claims to "
"read the physical MSP register."
msgstr ""
"调用者须保证该区域静默，且填充标记时没有活动栈帧。不依赖 Arch/OS，也不在内部屏蔽中断。工作量最多为 bytes "
"次读取。未被写入的保留区，或恰好等于填充值的写入，可能掩盖实际使用；这不是溢出检测。MSP "
"资格需要独立确认启动时填充标记的来源，以及静默的采样点。该跨度须排除当前 SP、全部活动栈帧及异常栈保留区。它既不填充栈，也不声称读取物理 MSP "
"寄存器。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "[in] Live downward-growing stack region, caller-provenance."
msgstr "[in] 调用者证明来源的、存续且向下增长的栈区域。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "[in] Original positive painted region capacity in bytes."
msgstr "[in] 原始已填充标记区域的正容量，单位为字节。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "[in] Exact fill used before the region became active."
msgstr "[in] 区域启用前使用的精确填充值。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on invalid span or alias."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；跨度或别名无效时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID, without allocation or retained pointers."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID，不分配内存，也不保留指针。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:64
msgid "Byte-prefix paint observations, not an exact physical stack peak."
msgstr "字节前缀涂色观察，不是准确的物理栈峰值。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:70
msgid "status.h"
msgstr "status.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:72
msgid "Small vendor-independent result vocabulary."
msgstr "精简且独立于厂商的结果集合。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:72
msgid "Operation result; success at submission means admission only."
msgstr "操作结果；提交时成功只表示已准入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:78
msgid "time.h"
msgstr "time.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Absolute monotonic microsecond deadlines and wrap extension."
msgstr "绝对单调微秒截止时间与回绕扩展。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Microseconds in one boot/clock domain; no wall-clock semantics."
msgstr "同一启动／时钟域内的微秒数，不具有墙上时钟语义。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Read the selected provider's monotonic clock."
msgstr "读取选定提供者的单调时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid ""
"Physical providers require successful platform startup and a privileged "
"task/configurable IRQ; NMI/HardFault callers are unsupported. No OS, "
"allocation or wait. Physical clocks return zero outside a successfully "
"started live epoch; zero alone cannot prove readiness. Startup status is "
"authoritative. All consumers join before clock withdrawal. Stop/restart or a"
" clock change invalidates every old deadline, even if a new epoch has the "
"same numerical value. UINT64_MAX is reserved; clock exhaustion requires "
"controlled restart. An observed hardware overflow acknowledgement failure "
"ends the live epoch and is terminal, even when finite source isolation "
"succeeds. The provider retains ownership, masks interrupts, calls "
"nx_fault_observe and parks if the observer returns. It never resumes "
"deadline consumers with invalid zero time. Observation neither releases "
"loans nor proves safe outputs; products own separately reviewed non-"
"returning recovery. Ordinary shutdown still requires every consumer and "
"optional low-power owner joined first."
msgstr ""
"物理 provider 要求平台已成功启动，调用者为特权任务／可配置 IRQ；不支持 NMI/HardFault 调用者。不调用 "
"OS、不分配内存，也不等待。物理时钟在已成功启动且仍存续的 epoch "
"之外返回零；仅凭零不能证明就绪，启动状态才是权威。撤销时钟前须等待全部消费者退出。停止／重启或时钟变化会使全部旧 deadline 失效，即使新 "
"epoch 的数值相同。UINT64_MAX 为保留值；时钟耗尽要求受控重启。若观察到硬件溢出确认失败，即使已成功隔离有限源，也会终止当前 "
"epoch，并进入不可继续的终态。provider 保留所有权、屏蔽中断、调用 "
"nx_fault_observe；若观察者返回则停驻。它绝不会以无效的零时间恢复 deadline "
"消费者。观察既不释放借用，也不证明安全输出；产品负责另行审查且不返回的恢复路径。普通关闭仍须先等待所有消费者及可选低功耗所有者退出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Microseconds since domain initialization."
msgstr "自时间域初始化以来的微秒数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Test an absolute deadline against a clock snapshot."
msgstr "依据时钟快照检查绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Absolute time or NX_DEADLINE_NEVER."
msgstr "[in] 绝对时间或 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Snapshot in the same clock domain."
msgstr "[in] 同一时钟域中的快照。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "True when a finite deadline has expired, including equality."
msgstr "有限 deadline 已到期时为 true，包含恰好相等的情况。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Add a duration without wrapping the monotonic domain."
msgstr "增加持续时间，不使单调时间域回绕。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Current finite time."
msgstr "[in] 当前有限时间。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Relative duration in microseconds."
msgstr "[in] 相对时长，单位为微秒。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Absolute deadline, saturating at NX_DEADLINE_NEVER."
msgstr "绝对 deadline，饱和于 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Construct a finite deadline without selecting infinite wait."
msgstr "构造有限 deadline，不选择无限等待。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ arithmetic, without reads of a clock, allocation or "
"retained references. Clock readiness and domain lifetime remain the caller's"
" responsibility. Use nx_deadline_after only when saturation to an infinite "
"wait is intentional."
msgstr ""
"有界的任务／IRQ 算术，不读取时钟、不分配，也不保留引用。时钟就绪和域生命周期仍由调用者负责。仅在明确希望饱和为无限等待时使用 "
"nx_deadline_after。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Current finite time in the consumer's clock domain."
msgstr "[in] 消费者时钟域中的当前有限时间。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Relative duration in microseconds; zero is valid."
msgstr "[in] 相对时长，单位微秒；零合法。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[out] Finite result, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 有限结果，失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid ""
"SUCCESS; INVALID for NULL output or nonfinite now; EXHAUSTED when the sum "
"reaches NX_DEADLINE_NEVER or would overflow."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；输出为 NULL 或 now 非有限时返回 INVALID；和达到 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER 或将溢出时返回 "
"EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Initialize counter extension and its clock domain."
msgstr "初始化计数扩展及其时钟域。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid ""
"Single execution owner. Reset creates a new clock domain; do not reuse "
"outstanding deadlines after reset/clock change."
msgstr "唯一执行所有者。复位会建立新的时钟域；复位／时钟变化后不得复用尚未完成的 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[out] Caller-owned extension state."
msgstr "[out] 调用者拥有的扩展状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] First hardware snapshot."
msgstr "[in] 第一次硬件快照。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Nonzero stable counter frequency."
msgstr "[in] 非零且稳定的计数器频率。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "NX_SUCCESS, or NX_ERROR_INVALID for invalid arguments."
msgstr "成功返回 NX_SUCCESS；参数无效返回 NX_ERROR_INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "Extend a wrapping counter and convert to microseconds."
msgstr "扩展回绕计数器并换算为微秒。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid ""
"Observe strictly before 2^32 ticks elapse, even when idle. Multiple missed "
"wraps cannot be detected from two snapshots, nor can one complete wrap at "
"equal snapshots. Counter must continue through waits; frequency cannot "
"change. No concurrent initialize/reset or observation."
msgstr ""
"必须在 2^32 个 tick "
"经过之前严格提前观察，即使空闲时也如此。两个快照无法检测漏过的多次回绕，也无法检测快照相等时恰好完整回绕一次。等待期间计数器必须持续运行，频率不得改变。不得并发初始化／复位或观察。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[inout] Initialized, single-owner extension state."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、仅有一个所有者的扩展状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[in] Current counter snapshot."
msgstr "[in] 当前计数器快照。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "[out] Distinct extended elapsed microseconds."
msgstr "[out] 独立的扩展后经过时间，单位微秒。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for NULL/overlapping output, STATE for an uninitialized "
"clock, or EXHAUSTED. Failure changes neither extension state nor output."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；输出为 NULL／重叠时返回 INVALID；时钟未初始化时返回 STATE；或返回 EXHAUSTED。失败不改变扩展状态或输出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "An explicitly injected clock; its context outlives all borrowers."
msgstr "显式注入的时钟；其上下文必须在所有借用者退出前保持有效。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:80
msgid "State for extending one 32-bit free-running hardware counter."
msgstr "用于扩展一个 32 位自由运行硬件计数器的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:85
msgid "silicon.h"
msgstr "silicon.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Explicit cold observed-silicon software admission."
msgstr "显式冷态已观测硅片的软件准入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Software review state, never physical qualification."
msgstr "软件审查状态，绝不代表物理验收。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Only REVIEWED and BLOCKED are valid authored rule values."
msgstr "手工规则只允许 REVIEWED 和 BLOCKED 两种值。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Read one explicit source before acquiring I/O resources."
msgstr "获取 I/O 资源前读取一个显式来源。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid ""
"Cold caller-serialized Thread context, O(rule_count) policy validation. "
"Malformed inputs reject before read. Source failure leaves output untouched."
" A completed comparison copies its rejection reason too; that never "
"authorizes startup. No reset, scheduling, clocks, IRQs or factory operations"
" are performed. Default platform behavior does not invoke this optional "
"explicit preflight."
msgstr ""
"仅在调用者串行化的冷态 Thread 上下文运行，策略校验复杂度为 "
"O(rule_count)。无效输入在读取前拒绝。来源失败时输出保持不变。已完成的比较也会复制拒绝原因；这不授予启动权限。不执行复位、调度、时钟、IRQ"
" 或 factory 操作。平台默认行为不调用此可选显式预检。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "[in] Stable source and context, no concurrent teardown."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的来源及上下文，不允许并发销毁。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "[in] Readonly policy/rules, stable during this call."
msgstr "[in] 只读策略／规则，在调用期间保持稳定。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid ""
"[out] Distinct aligned output; never aliases source context, complete "
"policy/rules or MMIO. No reference is retained."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出；不得与来源上下文、完整策略／规则或 MMIO 重叠。不保留任何引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid ""
"SUCCESS for admitted software policy, UNSUPPORTED for unknown/missing "
"revision, PERMISSION for blocked/missing workarounds, IO for group/density "
"mismatch, INVALID for malformed inputs; source errors propagate unchanged."
msgstr ""
"软件策略准入返回 SUCCESS；版本未知／缺失返回 UNSUPPORTED；被阻止／缺少规避措施返回 PERMISSION；器件组／容量不匹配返回 "
"IO；输入无效返回 INVALID；来源错误原样传播。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Observed silicon facts, without package or Board claims."
msgstr "已观测硅片事实，不包含封装或板卡声明。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid ""
"Device group and Flash density cannot identify an exact orderable part or "
"package. Assembly and physical inspection supply those independent facts. A "
"missing revision has a separate flag; numerical zero can be a real revision "
"ID."
msgstr ""
"器件组和 Flash 容量无法确定精确可订购料号或封装。这些独立事实由 assembly 和物理检查提供。版本缺失使用单独标志表示；数值零可能是真实版本"
" ID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "One reviewed exact revision and its mode-specific workarounds."
msgstr "一个已审查的精确版本及其模式相关规避措施。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Caller-selected immutable software review policy."
msgstr "调用者选择的不可变软件审查策略。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid ""
"Rules have strictly increasing revision IDs. Nonempty rules require a "
"nonzero SHA256 identifying their reviewed source record. This helper does "
"not authenticate that record or infer that required workarounds were "
"implemented; reviewed build/configuration facts supply the applied mask. "
"allow_unreviewed permits an explicitly observed unknown revision only. It "
"cannot override blocked revisions, a missing observation, mismatched "
"density/group or required workarounds. Empty rules describe no reviewed "
"revisions. No hardware test status is established by this policy."
msgstr ""
"规则的版本 ID 必须严格递增。非空规则须有非零 "
"SHA256，标识已审查的来源记录。此辅助机制不认证记录，也不推断所需规避措施是否实现；已审查的构建／配置事实提供已应用掩码。allow_unreviewed"
" 仅允许显式观测到的未知版本，不能覆盖被阻止版本、缺失观测、容量／器件组不匹配或所需规避措施。空规则表示没有已审查版本。此策略不建立任何硬件测试状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Explicit cold source; no discovery, effects or retained loan."
msgstr "显式冷态来源；不发现设备、不产生副作用、不保留借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid ""
"read executes once in caller context and copies facts into distinct "
"temporary output. The caller establishes legal MMIO, privilege, security and"
" cold Thread context first. A source must be bounded, allocation-free, read-"
"only, and return its actual access result. It must not enable clocks, repair"
" option bytes or retain output/context references."
msgstr ""
"read 在调用者上下文执行一次，将事实复制到独立临时输出。调用者先确保 MMIO、权限、安全域和冷态 Thread "
"上下文合法。来源必须有界、无分配、只读，并返回实际访问结果，不得启用时钟、修复 option bytes 或保留输出／上下文引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:87
msgid "Copied comparison facts; admitted is software permission only."
msgstr "复制的比较事实；admitted 仅表示软件许可。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:91
msgid "lifecycle.h"
msgstr "lifecycle.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Static, caller-owned cold resource transactions."
msgstr "静态、由调用者拥有的冷态资源事务。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Author  Nexus Team   Version  1.0.0   Date  2026-11-07   Copyright  "
"Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr ""
"作者  Nexus Team   版本  1.0.0   日期  2026-11-07   版权  Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus "
"Team"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "1.0.0"
msgstr "1.0.0"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "2026-11-07"
msgstr "2026-11-07"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr "Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Context admission reason; callbacks never establish context."
msgstr "上下文准入原因；回调不负责建立上下文。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Public observation of a serialized transaction, never a lock."
msgstr "串行化事务的公共观测，不是锁。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Admit every entry before acquiring in fixed order."
msgstr "按固定顺序获取资源前，对全部条目执行准入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid ""
"Caller-serialized cold context only. No heap, registry, graph resolution or "
"I/O forwarding. Invalid table bindings reject before callbacks. A failed "
"admission has no effects. Failed acquisition releases the retained current "
"step and previous steps in reverse order. First release failure stops "
"rollback and preserves the remaining cursor. Reentry returns BUSY. "
"ACTIVE/DRAINING start returns STATE. Caller proves aligned disjoint storage "
"and callback safety. Permanent pre-C memory owners, watchdogs and RTC/backup"
" domains stay outside this reversible plan."
msgstr ""
"仅限调用者串行化的冷态上下文。无堆、注册表、图解析或 I/O "
"转发。无效表绑定在回调前拒绝。准入失败不产生副作用。获取失败时，逆序释放当前保留步骤及此前步骤。首次释放失败即停止回滚，保留剩余游标。重入返回 "
"BUSY。ACTIVE／DRAINING 状态启动返回 STATE。调用者须证明存储对齐、互不重叠及回调安全。永久 pre-C 内存所有者、看门狗和 "
"RTC／备份域不属于此可逆计划。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "[in] Explicit valid plan; an empty plan is permitted."
msgstr "[in] 显式有效计划；允许空计划。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero state or completely released engine."
msgstr "[inout] 新的全零状态或已完全释放的引擎。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Start result; state.cleanup separately holds cleanup status."
msgstr "启动结果；state.cleanup 单独保存清理状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Release the remaining prefix in reverse order, with retry."
msgstr "逆序释放剩余前缀，支持重试。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid ""
"Complete release returns IDLE; repeated idle stop succeeds without "
"callbacks. A refused context or release preserves remaining responsibility. "
"Already released later entries are never released again. A different live "
"plan is rejected. Engine state is neither thread-safe nor interrupt-safe."
msgstr ""
"完全释放后返回 "
"IDLE；空闲状态重复停止成功且不调用回调。上下文拒绝或释放失败时保留剩余责任。已释放的后续条目不会再次释放。拒绝使用另一份活动计划。引擎状态既非线程安全，也非中断安全。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "[in] Exact plan used by the live engine."
msgstr "[in] 活动引擎实际使用的精确计划。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "[inout] Same live storage; never reset to escape a failure."
msgstr "[inout] 同一活动存储；不得重置以逃避失败。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Cleanup result; state.primary is preserved independently."
msgstr "清理结果；独立保留 state.primary。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Actual acquisition outcome and failed-step responsibility."
msgstr "实际获取结果及失败步骤的责任。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid ""
"A successful acquisition always receives one release call. On failure, "
"retained means the current step still requires release, including a failed "
"write with uncertain readback. The driver owns its concrete receipt in entry"
" state."
msgstr ""
"每次获取成功都对应一次释放调用。获取失败时 retained 表示当前步骤仍须释放，包括写入失败且回读不确定的情况。驱动在条目状态中拥有具体回执。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "One resource's effect-free admission and reversible work."
msgstr "单个资源的无副作用准入及可逆操作。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid ""
"admit validates without writes or retained references. acquire reports "
"actual partial responsibility on failure. release returns SUCCESS only when "
"that step has no remaining responsibility; failure preserves its receipt for"
" retry. Successful acquire may perform no writes; its release then performs "
"no work according to its concrete receipt."
msgstr ""
"admit 校验时不写入、不保留引用。acquire 在失败时报告实际部分责任。release 仅在该步骤不再承担任何责任时返回 "
"SUCCESS；失败须保留回执供重试。acquire 成功时也可能没有写入；其 release 按具体回执不执行操作。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Readonly binding; opaque state/config may be NULL if ops allow it."
msgstr "只读绑定；若 ops 允许，不透明 state／config 可为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Fixed dependency order and explicit context admission."
msgstr "固定依赖顺序及显式上下文准入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid ""
"All entries, ops, config and context remain immutable and alive until "
"complete release. Entry state remains alive and exclusively owned. "
"context_check is bounded and effect-free; START admission also covers "
"immediate failure rollback. STOP admission runs on each explicit non-idle "
"stop attempt."
msgstr ""
"所有条目、ops、config 及 context 在完全释放前保持不可变且有效。条目状态保持有效并由单一所有者独占。context_check "
"有界且无副作用；START 准入也涵盖获取失败后的即时回滚。每次显式非空闲停止尝试均执行 STOP 准入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid "Zero-initialized caller-owned engine state."
msgstr "全零初始化、由调用者拥有的引擎状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:93
msgid ""
"Fields are readonly to callers after first use. cursor is the unreleased "
"prefix, not a hardware receipt. primary keeps the most recent start failure;"
" cleanup keeps the latest cleanup result independently. No config pointer is"
" copied into RAM beyond bound plan identity. Separate live engines must own "
"disjoint entry state and hardware responsibility."
msgstr ""
"首次使用后，调用者只读这些字段。cursor 表示尚未释放的前缀，不是硬件回执。primary 保存最近一次启动失败；cleanup "
"独立保存最近清理结果。RAM 中除绑定计划身份外不复制配置指针。不同活动引擎的条目状态和硬件责任必须互不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:97
msgid "platform_lifecycle.h"
msgstr "platform_lifecycle.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Static platform coordination and call-scoped diagnostics."
msgstr "静态平台协调与调用期诊断。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Cold lifecycle stage; errors remain in the normal result."
msgstr "冷态生命周期阶段；错误仍由正常返回结果报告。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "A drain failure remains distinct from a completed suspension."
msgstr "排空失败与已完成挂起保持区分。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Start the selected system, resources and physical owners."
msgstr "启动选定系统、资源及物理所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Caller-serialized cold context only. Context is checked before effects and "
"again before immediate rollback. Failed initialization withdraws the "
"retained prefix in reverse order, stopping at the first refusal. Start of a "
"live platform returns STATE; synchronous reentry returns BUSY without "
"changing the supplied diagnostic output. No allocation, discovery, scheduler"
" or I/O forwarding."
msgstr ""
"仅限调用者串行化的冷态上下文。产生副作用前和立即回滚前均检查上下文。初始化失败时逆序撤回保留前缀，首次拒绝即停止。活动平台再次启动返回 "
"STATE；同步重入返回 BUSY，且不修改传入的诊断输出。无分配、发现、调度器或 I/O 转发。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[in] Immutable typed dispatch and resolved ordinals."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的类型化分发及已解析序号。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[inout] Caller-owned zero or completely released storage."
msgstr "[inout] 调用者拥有的全零或已完全释放存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[out] Optional call-scoped metadata; never retained."
msgstr "[out] 可选调用期元数据；不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Primary result, independent cleanup result and effects."
msgstr "主结果、独立清理结果及副作用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Retry remaining controllers, shared resources and system."
msgstr "重试剩余控制器、共享资源及系统的释放。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Join direct writers, IRQ consumers and borrowers first. Continue service "
"before retrying BUSY. A failure retains the remaining prefix and system; "
"already released later controllers are not repeated. Even idle stop checks "
"context and permanent resource guards. Synchronous reentry returns BUSY "
"without writing diagnostic. Caller serialization and each owner's "
"context/deadline contracts remain mandatory."
msgstr ""
"先 join 直接写入者、IRQ 消费者和借用者。返回 BUSY "
"后，重试前继续推进服务。失败时保留剩余前缀及系统；已释放的后续控制器不会重复释放。即使空闲停止也检查上下文和永久资源守卫。同步重入返回 "
"BUSY，不写诊断。调用者串行化及各所有者的上下文／截止时间合同始终必须满足。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[in] Exact live plan, or the original idle platform plan."
msgstr "[in] 精确活动计划，或原空闲平台计划。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[inout] Same storage and retained concrete owner receipts."
msgstr "[inout] 同一存储及保留的具体所有者回执。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[out] Optional call-scoped output; never retained."
msgstr "[out] 可选调用期输出；不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "SUCCESS only after all dedicated owners prove withdrawal."
msgstr "仅在全部专属所有者证明已撤回后返回 SUCCESS。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Drain controllers and shared resources while retaining System."
msgstr "排空控制器和共享资源，同时保留 System。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Joins every application borrower first. Optional suspend hooks keep "
"independent autonomous domains; absent hooks use ordinary release. This does"
" not enter sleep, alter time, feed watchdogs or cancel loans. A suspended "
"plan remains bound and cannot be replaced or fully stopped until resume "
"reestablishes the retained owners. Reentry returns BUSY."
msgstr ""
"先 join 全部应用借用者。可选挂起 hook 保留独立自治域；缺少 hook "
"时使用普通释放。此操作不进入睡眠、不改变时间、不喂看门狗，也不取消借用。挂起计划仍保持绑定；在 resume "
"重建保留所有者前，不得替换计划或完全停止。重入返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[in] Same immutable plan that established the live platform."
msgstr "[in] 建立活动平台时使用的同一不可变计划。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[inout] Exact retained owner, serialized by the caller."
msgstr "[inout] 精确保留的所有者，由调用者串行化。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[out] Optional call-scoped phase/ordinal, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 可选调用期阶段／序号，不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after complete drain; BUSY/IO keeps the remaining prefix and "
"System. Resume is refused until suspension completes."
msgstr "仅在完全排空后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 保留剩余前缀及 System。挂起完成前拒绝恢复。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Rebuild the same static cold controllers after System restoration."
msgstr "System 恢复后重建同一组静态冷态控制器。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Does not invoke system_start, start a scheduler or replay requests. The SoC "
"power owner establishes the replacement time epoch first. Each concrete "
"cold/resume owner performs its real hardware admission; resources_resume "
"reacquires shared pins/resources before controllers. Missing optional hooks "
"use ordinary acquire/resources_acquire. Product code explicitly "
"bridges/replaces deadlines and resubmits work."
msgstr ""
"不调用 system_start、不启动调度器，也不重放请求。SoC "
"电源所有者先建立新时间纪元。各具体冷态／恢复所有者执行真实硬件准入；resources_resume 在控制器之前重新获取共享引脚／资源。缺少可选 "
"hook 时采用普通 acquire／resources_acquire。产品代码显式桥接或替换截止时间并重新提交工作。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[in] Same immutable static connections, with System already live."
msgstr "[in] 同一不可变静态连接，System 已经处于活动状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"[inout] Successfully suspended owner, not a partially drained or ordinary "
"stopped platform."
msgstr "[inout] 已成功挂起的所有者，不得是部分排空或普通已停止的平台。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "[out] Optional call-scoped primary/cleanup metadata."
msgstr "[out] 可选调用期主结果／清理元数据。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Primary/cleanup result; System remains retained even after a clean resume "
"rollback. Failed drain leaves SUSPENDING and blocks retry."
msgstr "主结果／清理结果；即使恢复回滚成功，仍保留 System。排空失败保持 SUSPENDING 并阻止重试。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Independent startup and cleanup results, retained effects."
msgstr "独立的启动和清理结果，以及保留副作用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"remaining_effects describes still-owned platform effects, including an "
"already-live platform after a refused restart; it is not a count of effects "
"newly acquired by this call. Dedicated system nonzero effect masks remain "
"intact. The coordinator uses bit zero as a generic responsibility flag."
msgstr ""
"remaining_effects "
"描述平台仍拥有的副作用，包括重启遭拒后仍活动的平台；它不表示本次调用新获取的副作用数量。专属系统的非零副作用掩码保持完整。协调器用第零位作通用责任标志。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Caller-owned metadata, accessed only during this call."
msgstr "调用者拥有的元数据，仅在本次调用期间访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Controller indices are resolved controller positions, not typed factory IDs."
" SIZE_MAX means no controller. Success clears every field. Cleanup never "
"replaces primary facts."
msgstr ""
"控制器索引表示解析后的控制器位置，不是强类型 factory ID。SIZE_MAX 表示没有控制器。成功时清零全部字段。清理结果绝不覆盖主结果事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Fixed platform connections, without per-controller state."
msgstr "固定平台连接，不含逐控制器状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Callbacks dispatch exact typed owners; no runtime lookup, register "
"interpreter or generic action stream is involved. Every admission finishes "
"before system_start. A successful system_start establishes the system "
"boundary; a failed one reports its own cleanup and retained effects. "
"Resources may retain effects after failed acquisition and always receive "
"release before the system. resources_release also checks permanent pre-C "
"owners, even when no controller started. Controller acquire reports failed-"
"step responsibility; release succeeds only after the concrete receipt is "
"clear. Permanent SRAM, RTC and watchdog policy remains in those dedicated C "
"owners. permanent_effects marks pre-C effects on every failed start, "
"including context rejection. At most UINT16_MAX physical controllers are "
"permitted; larger plans reject before any owner callback."
msgstr ""
"回调直接分发到精确类型的所有者；不涉及运行时查找、寄存器解释器或通用动作流。全部准入在 system_start 前完成。system_start "
"成功建立系统边界；失败则报告自身清理结果和保留副作用。资源获取失败后可能仍保留副作用，且总在系统前执行资源释放。resources_release "
"即使没有控制器启动，也检查永久 pre-C 所有者。控制器 acquire 报告失败步骤责任；只有具体回执清空后 release 才成功。永久 "
"SRAM、RTC 及看门狗策略保留在其专属 C 所有者中。permanent_effects 在每次启动失败时标出 pre-C "
"副作用，包括上下文拒绝。物理控制器最多 UINT16_MAX 个；超出时在任何所有者回调前拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid "Zero-initialized storage for one serialized platform."
msgstr "单个串行化平台使用的全零初始化存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/core.md:99
msgid ""
"Fields are readonly to callers. initialized is the remaining physical-"
"controller prefix; dedicated owners retain their own receipts. bound is an "
"opaque identity that forbids changing a live plan. operating rejects "
"synchronous callback reentry; it is not a task lock. Plan, static "
"connections and owner storage remain alive and unchanged until complete "
"withdrawal. Separate platforms must own disjoint hardware and mutable owner "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"调用者只读这些字段。initialized 表示剩余物理控制器前缀；专属所有者各自保留回执。bound "
"为不透明身份，禁止更改活动计划。operating "
"拒绝同步回调重入，不是任务锁。计划、静态连接及所有者存储在完全撤回前保持有效且不变。不同平台必须拥有互不重叠的硬件及可变所有者存储。"
